{
 "_doc": "Manifest for the fauna zone records, written by hand and kept in step with the zone files. A static host cannot be globbed, which is why this exists. habitat, in_modelled_extent, extent_from and species_count are DENORMALISED COPIES so a renderer can work from one fetch; the zone record is authoritative and tools/validate.py fails the build if they disagree. A zone does not carry its own geometry: extent_from names the flora zone whose extent it shares, so the two datasets cannot drift apart, and in_modelled_extent must equal that flora zone's plantable_in_scene. Zones f07 and f08 have no modelled ground in this scene and place nothing. EVERY RECORD IS STATED FOR 1 JULY: the july block carries the state of the animal on the scene date, not its state in the year.",
