  "_doc": "Closed sets. presence_modes is the heart of this dataset: 'audible' means present and NOT SEEN, 'trace_only' means present as sign only, 'not_perceptible' means present and neither seen nor heard on this date, 'absent' means not here at all, and 'not_depicted' means here and deliberately not shown. vocalization carries the July gate for birds \u2014 'display_over' is a lek or display season that has finished, and 'song_full' is the exceptional July claim and must be argued on the record."
